id: CTB-SRC0010-r3
source: SRC-0010
section: §19
kind: requirement
text: By rule R3, nothing is synchronised by hand: committed generated files must equal a fresh generation, and CI checks it. After successful assimilation, regenerate or update the dependent indexes, registries, relationships, specifications, documentation, conformance views, test obligations and implementation traceability from canonical knowledge; derived representations never become authorities.
